class_name IconLibrary
extends RefCounted
## Every icon in the game, as vector strokes. Icons are drawn at whatever size
## is asked for, so they stay sharp on any screen and need no image files.
##
## An icon is a list of operations in a -1..1 box (y down):
##   ["l", [x0,y0, x1,y1, ...]]   open polyline
##   ["L", [...]]                 closed polyline
##   ["p", [...]]                 filled polygon
##   ["c", x, y, r]               circle outline
##   ["d", x, y, r]               filled disc
##   ["a", x, y, r, deg0, deg1]   arc (degrees, clockwise from +x)
##
## To swap in bitmap icons later, make IconGlyph prefer a texture when one
## exists for the id and fall back to this.

